./packages/astro/CHANGELOG-v6.md:2158:- [#15279](https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15279) [`8983f17`](https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/8983f17d530b63d230ffb06f7ce65476f77c60b5) Thanks [@ematipico](https://github.com/ematipico)! - Fixes an issue where the dev server would serve files like `/README.md` from the project root when they shouldn't be accessible. A new route guard middleware now blocks direct URL access to files that exist outside of `srcDir` and `publicDir`, returning a 404 instead.
